/**
 * "Does {platform} notify when you {action}?" — the data behind /does-it-notify. One entry per
 * platform × action: a plain yes / no / partly answer, the rule in a sentence, the exceptions that
 * trip people up, what the other person can actually see, and how to be sure. Only facts about
 * the platforms; nothing here claims a Schedule For You feature. `verified` is when the entries
 * were last checked against the platforms' help centers and behaviour: change an answer only
 * with a source, and bump the date when you re-check.
 */
