    'like-unlike': { answer: 'partly', rule: 'A like sends a notification; unliking removes the entry, but a push may already have gone out.', detail: 'Likes appear in the creator\'s activity and, if enabled, as push notifications. Unliking removes the activity entry; an already-delivered push stays on their device until dismissed.', except: ['Popular videos group likes together, so one like is rarely noticed.'], sees: 'Possibly a push notification.', sure: 'Assume it was seen if it stayed for more than a few seconds.' },
